description:
Returns ReadingRate's summary of one calendar month of the reader's reading: books finished, time and pages read, the difficulty of what they read, highlights, and how the month compares with the year so far. Summaries are made after each month ends.

Use when the reader asks how a particular month of reading went. For any other range of dates, such as a year or a season, use summarize_reading_period.

Example: {"year": 2026, "month": 9}
